{
  "name": "42 · Daily Task Assigner (Kaamchor AI · MAP 3.0)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 42 · Daily Task Assigner\nWrite tomorrow's tasks in a sheet tonight. At 8 AM every staff member gets **their own** task list on WhatsApp (urgent ones first) and the owner gets a one-line summary.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Google Sheets nodes: add a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential and paste your sheet link in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Tasks**: Date (yyyy-mm-dd), Task, Assigned to, Priority, Where / notes. Tab **Staff**: Name, Phone.\n2. WhatsApp nodes: add a **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential and replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID with your Phone Number ID (Meta → WhatsApp → API setup). Replace YOUR_OWNER_WHATSAPP with the owner's WhatsApp number in 91XXXXXXXXXX format.\n3. AI model node: add an **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).\n\nStaff should message your business number once so WhatsApp lets you reply (24-hour rule), or use a template.",
        "height": 616,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "a9d9c57e-6b8f-4e37-a6c6-746e3c0a8fcb",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 8,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "43038d13-1bcd-4db3-8753-b45e5a859363",
      "name": "Daily 8 AM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
